abstract: "Every stock-market-listed wine company VINCAP (formerly BoomCellar) has found: permanent IDs, identifiers, index status, share counts with their filing sources, and an exit register for companies that left the market, each exit graded by evidence. Edition 2026-10-16 of data package v1.24, byte-identical to https://vincap.co/data. Free to use, including commercially, with attribution to VINCAP. Information, not investment advice."
